id: 2
hanzi: 军事
pinyin: jūn shì
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: military affairs; military matters; army defense
  es: asuntos militares; milicia; arte de la guerra

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | affairs, activities, equipment, and operations relating to armed forces, warfare, and national defense | actividades, pertrechos y operaciones relativas a las fuerzas armadas, la guerra y la defensa nacional | 军事演习 (military exercise)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 战国时期的著名军事家孙武所著的《孙子兵法》，被誉为世界上最古老而深刻的军事理论经典。 | Zhànguó shíqī de zhùmíng jūnshìjiā Sūn Wǔ suǒ zhù de Sūnzǐ Bīngfǎ, bèi yù wéi shìjiè shang zuì gǔlǎo ér shēnkè de jūnshì lǐlùn jīngdiǎn. | The Art of War, authored by renowned military strategist Sun Wu, is hailed as the world's oldest and most profound military theory classic. | El arte de la guerra, escrito por el insigne militar Sun Wu, es ensalzado como el tratado de estrategia bélica más antiguo y profundo del orbe.
  #2 | 两国边境防务代表团就共同关心的军事安全问题举行了坦诚而深入的会谈。 | Liǎng guó biānjìng fángwù dàibiǎotuán jiù gòngtóng guānxīn de jūnshì ānquán wèntí jǔxíng le tǎncéng ér shēnrù de huìtán. | Border defense delegations from both countries held candid, in-depth talks on shared military and security concerns. | Delegaciones fronterizas de ambos países mantuvieron un diálogo franco y pormenorizado sobre asuntos de seguridad y defensa militar.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  军事行动 | military operation
  军事基地 | military base
  军事演习 | military drill / exercise
